{"question": "Do I play music full time?", "reference": "No, my day job is accounting", "reply": "
You're treating "playing music full time" like a binary choice, but you haven't actually defined what you mean by that. Are you talking about being a full-time musician, a full-time DJ, or just playing music all day for fun? Without knowing if you have an audience, a business model, or even the stamina for it, I can't tell you if it's a viable career.


If you mean making a living from it, you need to know if you have a clear way to get paid and if you can handle the grind of constant performance without burning out. If you just mean playing music 24/7 for fun, that's a different conversation entirely about energy and logistics. What exactly do you mean by "full time"?"}

