You have one child named Leo, who just started first grade. The data shows you read around fifty books this year, and the conversation so far has focused only on your reading habits and Leo's schooling. Since you haven't mentioned any other children or partners in this conversation, I am assuming you are single or the children you read about are not relevant to your current life. Are you asking because you are surprised by the number, or because you are trying to plan for the next big step with Leo? I don't know if you want to talk about school or your reading habits.


